      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the review. Item.layer.effect is a Component, not the instantiated DropShadow. Qt documents its type explicitly:\nhttps://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qml-qtquick-item.html#layer.effect-prop\n\nTestCase.createTemporaryObject(Component, ...) expects exactly that type, instantiates it and handles automatic cleanup:\nhttps://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qml-qttest-testcase.html#createTemporaryObject-method\n\nThe temporary instance lets this test verify the declared shadow parameters and is automatically destroyed after the test. The suggested direct assignment would leave shadow pointing to a Component, whose DropShadow-specific properties are not available.\n\nThis finding is therefore a false positive. Could you please reconsider the -1?",
